  "description": "Nalix.Logging is a lightweight, asynchronous logging subsystem designed STRICTLY for DEVELOPMENT environments within the Nalix ecosystem.\n\n⚠️ WARNING: This logging library is NOT intended for production use. It is designed to provide quick, debug-friendly console and file outputs during the development phase. For production environments, please use a robust, production-ready logging framework such as Serilog, NLog, or an OpenTelemetry-compatible sink.",
