  "releaseNotes": "- Development Only: Explicitly marked as a development-only tool. Do NOT use in production environments.\n- Asynchronous Performance: Basic channel-based logging engine designed for non-blocking local execution.\n- Simple Targets: Built-in sinks including basic file I/O and console output for debugging purposes.\n- Unified Facade: Provides simple NLogix access points for development-phase logging.",
